    "summary": "In your Shooting phase, once this unit has shot, it can make 1 of these moves if it is outside **Engagement Range** of all enemy units:\n\n- a **Normal move** up to 6\"\n- a Normal move up to 12\", ending with all its models wholly within 6\" of a friendly **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS BATTLELINE** unit\n\nIf it makes either move, it cannot declare a charge for the rest of the turn.",
